# Client delivery duplicates. The identical originals are tracked in
# /brand-source (verified byte-for-byte), which is what scripts/generate-icons.mjs
# reads. Committing these too would add ~6 MB of duplicates to git history
# permanently. Delete these two lines if you want them tracked after all.
/Logo/
/Logo.zip
